# EdinForm Landing Page — Cursor Rules

## Project
EdinForm is a form-builder SaaS (like Typeform/Tally but premium).
Built with: Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS (or inline styles).
Landing page lives at: app/(marketing)/page.tsx or app/page.tsx

## Design system
CSS variables on :root and [data-theme="dark"]:
  --bg, --surface, --text, --muted, --border (see top of page.tsx)
  --green: #2D6A4F (primary accent, Edinburgh nature)
  --yellow: #F4C430 (highlight, Scottish thistle)
  --red: #D62828 (error/warning states)
Font: Inter (Google Fonts). No Cormorant Garamond.
All colors MUST use CSS variables. No hardcoded hex values in components.

## Component map
- EdinburghSkylineHero: SVG panorama, hover tooltips, draw-in animation
- HeroFormCard: 3-step mini form demo (top of hero)
- FormFlowDiagram: 5-step lifecycle, vertical stepper, auto-cycles
- BranchingVisualiser: click Yes/No trace diagram (conditional logic section)
- ResponseWave: animated bar chart with date labels (analytics section)
- LiveDemoForm: 6-question full demo + sidebar (demo section)
- Counter: count-up animation component
- Reveal: IntersectionObserver fade-up wrapper

## Animation rules
- ALL animations wrapped in @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)
- IntersectionObserver threshold: 0.15 for most sections
- Stagger delays: 80ms between siblings
- Duration standard: 0.6s ease-out for reveals, 0.3s for hover states
- NO CSS animations on server-render — use useEffect + useState

## Edinburgh theme
Illustrations reference: Arthur's Seat, Edinburgh Castle, Scott Monument,
Calton Hill, Scottish thistle, Forth Bridge, Hogmanay.
SVG style: flat, minimal, 2-color max per illustration.
Colors in illustrations: var(--green) for nature, #111 for architecture,
var(--yellow) for highlights.

## Empty space rule
NO section may have more than 80px of vertical whitespace without content.
Every left/right column in a two-column layout must have ≥ 3 content blocks.
If a column only has text, add one of: stat card / illustration / quote / 
feature list / integration row.

## Accessibility
- All interactive elements: focus-visible ring 2px var(--green)
- Color contrast: min 4.5:1 for body text, 3:1 for large text
- All SVG illustrations: role="img" aria-label="..."
- All form inputs: associated <label> elements
- Keyboard navigation: tab order logical, Enter activates buttons

## File structure
app/
  page.tsx          ← main landing page (all sections)
  layout.tsx        ← fonts, theme provider
components/
  brand/logo.tsx    ← EdinFormLogo, EdinFormMark
  ui/               ← shared UI primitives
lib/
  auth.ts           ← isAuthenticated()
.cursorrules        ← this file
